msgid ""
"1. the Before farming list, top to bottom; 2. the farming, until the plan ends or the daily stop before the game's day reset; 3. the After farming list, when the farming ended by itself (not after Stop). These are the same lists as Character settings, Triggers. The script of the day is written from them once; after that it is yours to change, until you write it again."
msgstr ""
"1. Farming se pehle wali list, upar se neeche; 2. farming, jab tak plan khatam na ho ya game ke din badalne se pehle roz ka stop na aa jaye; 3. Farming ke baad wali list, jab farming khud khatam hui ho (Stop ke baad nahi). Yeh wahi listein hain jo Character settings, Triggers mein hain. Din ka script in se ek baar likha jata hai; us ke baad woh aap ka hai, jab tak aap use dobara na likhwayein."

