msgid ""
"A file that reaches the size above is kept as name.1, the older ones move to name.2 and so on, and the oldest is dropped. The day's run log is rotated the same way inside its day."
msgstr ""
"Jo file upar di gayi size tak pahunch jaye woh name.1 ke tor par rakhi jaati hai, us se purani name.2 par chali jaati hai aur isi tarah aage, aur sab se purani hata di jaati hai. Din ka run log bhi apne din ke andar isi tarah rotate hota hai."

