msgid ""
"The bot finds a guard (in sight, where one was seen before, or in the nearest town), switches the PK mode to all mode, hits the guard once and lets it kill the character: no potions, no heals, no fighting back. It respawns in the city and goes again until the next level needs at least that much experience. At the nearest village, it walks into the nearest village first (the game brings a dead character back at the last town it walked into), then dies at its gates, so each death is quicker (on Tuneful Wetland, 11 seconds at Aria Village against 29 at Tulip City); if the game brings it back somewhere else, it dies at the nearest guard instead. Each death takes a share of the experience earned in the level, so each costs a little less than the last: after three deaths the bot says how many more it will take, and it stops if the level can't reach your number. The pet is put away first, and the PK mode is put back at the end. Deaths wear your gear like any death; a black-name character (Morality -1000 or lower) can lose worn gear when it dies, so the XP loser won't run for one."
msgstr ""
"Bot ek guard dhoondta hai (nazar mein, jahan pehle dekha gaya, ya qareebi shehar mein), PK mode all mode par karta hai, guard ko ek baar maarta hai aur character ko marne deta hai: na potion, na heal, na jawabi larai. Woh shehar mein dobara zinda hota hai aur tab tak dobara jata hai jab tak agle level ko kam az kam itni experience na chahiye. Qareebi gaon wale choice mein woh pehle qareebi gaon ke andar jata hai (game mare hue character ko us aakhri shehar mein wapas lata hai jis mein woh dakhil hua tha), phir us ke darwazon par marta hai, is liye har maut jaldi hoti hai (Tuneful Wetland par Aria Village mein 11 seconds, Tulip City mein 29); agar game use kahin aur wapas laye to woh is ke bajaye qareebi guard ke paas marta hai. Pehle pet wapas rakha jata hai, aur aakhir mein PK mode wapas lagaya jata hai. Har maut ki tarah gear ghista hai; black-name character (Morality -1000 ya kam) marne par pehna hua gear kho sakta hai, is liye XP loser us ke liye nahi chalega. Har death level mein kamaye hue experience ka ek hissa leti hai, is liye har death pichhli se thora kam leti hai: teen deaths ke baad bot batata hai ke kitni aur lagengi, aur agar level aap ke number tak nahi pohanch sakta to ruk jata hai."

msgid "The bot is busy on this game. Stop it first (Stop), then try again."
msgstr ""
"Bot is game par masroof hai. Pehle use rokein (Rok), phir dobara koshish karein."

