msgstr ""
"Bot maqsad aur maut ki tadaad khud tay karta hai: jab ek maut level ka 0.05% se kam le, to ruk jata hai (level ka taqreeban 97%). Upar wali maut ki had sirf tab tak lagti hai jab tak bot level ko na jaan le: teen maut ke baad, ya foran agar pichle run ne seekh liya ho."

