msgid ""
"The characters farm one after the other in the game selected when the chain starts. Each one is logged in by itself (its saved account), does its plan or its Autopilot day, and is done for the game's day when its run ends by itself; then the next one comes. Stop ends the whole chain. A character done with more than 10 minutes of drop time left is done again once the others are."
msgstr ""
"Kirdaar ek ke baad ek us game mein farm karte hain jo chain shuru hote waqt chuna gaya ho. Har ek khud log in hota hai (us ka mahfooz account), apna plan ya Autopilot din karta hai, aur jab us ka run khud khatam ho to game ke din ke liye mukammal ginaa jata hai; phir agla aata hai. Stop poori chain rok deta hai. Jis kirdaar ke paas 10 minute se zyada drop time bacha ho, woh baaqi sab ke baad dobara kiya jata hai."

